Z||000003||SLYGUY||11-22-2001||04:17 AM||||Lamborghini does in fact call it the "Murcielago". <BR>Estimated price is somewhere near $300K.<P>I couldn't believe how many similarities there are between the Fiero and this car. In every picture and at nearly every angle this car is a Fiero.<P>When you see a picture of the cabin you will agree. Deep buckets seperated by a tall center tunnel, similar dashboard, etc.<BR>Imitation is the sincerest form of flattery for sure!!!<P>Sly||||reg||1
